# Docker

```
## Clean
### local
rm -rf node_m* *lock* dist

###
sudo docker stop doorjs
sudo docker rm doorjs
sudo docker rmi $(sudo docker images -q)
sudo docker builder prune -a

## Build && Run
sudo docker build -t doorjs . && sudo docker run --name doorjs --cap-add=SYS_ADMIN -d doorjs

## Logs
sudo docker logs -f doorjs
```
